   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The model touches only two agents. Ask Analyst: picks a tool and words the answer (loop capped at 4 trips). Claims\nIntake: intent fallback when no keyword matches, and rewording the reply, which is dropped if it changes a figure.",
